TI  - Impact of different teaching modes on medical students’ performance under the scoring criteria for multiple-choice questions: A meta-analysis
AU  - Zhaoqi Zhang
AU  - Zhuo Zhang
AU  - Ye Yu
AU  - Mengqi Jiang
AU  - Lili Deng
AU  - Lianying Guo
JO  - Medicine
PY  - 2024
VL  - 103
