TI  - Motivating Students to Engage in Preparation for Flipped Classrooms by Using Embedded Quizzes in Pre-class Videos
AU  - Emily P. Jones
AU  - Amy E. Wahlquist
AU  - Melissa Hortman
AU  - Christopher S. Wisniewski
JO  - INNOVATIONS in pharmacy
PY  - 2021
VL  - 12
